title: "Learned Cumulant Closure"
abstract: >-
  A permutation-equivariant, Hermiticity-preserving learned third-cumulant closure that
  recovers the superradiant burst peak of an open, disordered Tavis-Cummings ensemble,
  benchmarked against exact master-equation (QuTiP), permutation-invariant, and
  quantum-trajectory references.
